  "prefLabel": "Tra 902.06 Account Adjustments",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tra 902.06 Account Adjustments.\n\n(a) In the event a person underpays any registration, toll, penalty, or other fee required, the payment shall be processed pursuant to RSA 6:11-a.\n\n(b) Pursuant to RSA 422:31, IX, amounts of less than $5 shall not be refunded if the cost to the state to refund the overpayment would exceed the amount involved.\n\nSource. #7997, eff 12-1-03; ss by #10034, eff 11-23-11 (formerly Tra 901.07)\n\nNew. #13480, eff 11-3-22 (formerly Tra 902.07)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/tra900.html"
